WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
- I heard that you don't
actually watch scary movies.

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:02.870
- [Jamie] Oh please.
- I don't.

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:03.880
I don't, you do?

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:04.910
- I hate them.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:06.300
I scare easily.
- Me too.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.080
- As a child, I scared easily.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:11.120
And I think it's probably
what makes me a good actress

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:12.380
in these films,
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:16.043
because I'm just genuinely
terrified all the time.

00:00:16.043 --> 00:00:18.530
And I, you know, if we had more time,

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:20.817
I'd pull up a picture of me as
an infant and you'd be like,

00:00:20.817 --> 00:00:23.960
"Oh wow," because I looked
startled and terrified.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:24.793
- Oh my God.

00:00:24.793 --> 00:00:25.626
I'm the same way.

00:00:25.626 --> 00:00:26.459
I hate it.

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:27.320
I don't like to be jumped out at.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:28.153
- No, no, no, no.

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:28.986
I startle easily.

00:00:28.986 --> 00:00:29.920
- Oh yeah, I don't do...

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:30.753
What are those called?

00:00:30.753 --> 00:00:31.586
The haunted houses?
- No.

00:00:31.586 --> 00:00:32.419
- I don't do those.
- No.

00:00:32.419 --> 00:00:33.252
- No,

00:00:33.252 --> 00:00:34.824
- Who would go into a haunted house?

00:00:34.824 --> 00:00:37.193
- It is a lawsuit waiting to happen.

00:00:37.193 --> 00:00:38.490
I saw a raise of hands.

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:39.355
She's like, "I would."

00:00:39.355 --> 00:00:40.960
- Who did?

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:42.410
But why?
- But I want to hit them.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:43.480
Somebody jumps out at me...

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.780
Look, it's my reaction.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:45.613
I'm ready.

00:00:45.613 --> 00:00:47.710
You shouldn't jump out at me.

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:48.543
- No, no, no.

00:00:48.543 --> 00:00:49.534
I'm not down with it.

00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:50.367
- Okay.

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:53.738
You traveled with your parents
when they were on movie sets.

00:00:53.738 --> 00:00:55.490
First of all, I'm asking,
did that mess you up?

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:56.670
Because my kids come to set a lot.

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:57.503
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:57.503 --> 00:00:59.446
You had a good childhood, right?

00:00:59.446 --> 00:01:00.697
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:00.697 --> 00:01:01.530
- Well.

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:03.400
- Okay.
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:04.233
I always ask-

00:01:04.233 --> 00:01:05.066
- Yes, it was fine.

00:01:05.066 --> 00:01:05.899
It was fine, it was good.

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:06.732
Everything's good.

00:01:06.732 --> 00:01:07.565
Everything's good.

00:01:07.565 --> 00:01:08.398
- I always worry.

00:01:08.398 --> 00:01:09.910
I'm like, "Should I have
my kids around a lot?"

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:10.743
I'm always wondering-

00:01:10.743 --> 00:01:11.576
- You know what?

00:01:11.576 --> 00:01:12.500
They love being with you.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:14.152
- Okay, okay, okay.
- They love you.

00:01:14.152 --> 00:01:16.650
- Did you get into
trouble, though, on set?

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:17.550
Did you ever-

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:21.910
- Well, movie sets are
a nightmare to visit,

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:24.463
because you do this the entire time.

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:27.443
- Oh, exactly.

00:01:27.443 --> 00:01:28.276
Yeah.

00:01:28.276 --> 00:01:29.109
- You have to be silent.
- Yeah.

00:01:29.109 --> 00:01:31.510
- It's terrible as a child.
- Okay.

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:33.280
- I think what you're referring to is

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:35.420
that there is a picture of me.

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:38.360
My dad did a movie in South
America called "Taras Bulba".

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:41.460
Tony Curtis made a movie and I,

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:43.410
that little girl right there.

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:45.036
So cute.

00:01:45.036 --> 00:01:46.379
So cute.

00:01:46.379 --> 00:01:47.290
- I love camping.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:48.780
- Except until the day

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:51.430
that Tony's driver was playing with me,

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:53.378
threw me up in the air and missed me.

00:01:53.378 --> 00:01:54.211
(Kelly gasps)

00:01:54.211 --> 00:01:56.310
And I ended up with a...

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:59.810
There was a picture of me
and I'm like a little girl

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:00.740
with a little sling.

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:02.306
I know.
- Oh wow.

00:02:02.306 --> 00:02:04.010
- Hey, sets are dangerous.

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:05.110
Look, I'm in horror films.

00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:05.943
Believe me.

